the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"text":" extension. The examples on this page are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"small pieces you can combine in one file; a game does not need a "},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"function. Start with "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript"},{"type":"text","text":" to run a complete system."}],"kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptbasics","role":"article","title":"Ada Script Basics"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/GettingStartedWithAdaScript":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript","title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","role":"article"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Write gameplay systems in Ada Script while keeping entity filtering and access planning in AdaEngine’s native ECS."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting","role":"collection","title":"Ada Script"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLibraries":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Share reusable AdaScript functions, systems, and scriptable objects through a GitHub repository.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"AdaEditor installs the library and its transitive dependencies into the project. Run, Play Mode,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Preview, and ","type":"text"},{"type"